# Copy to the root of the repo you are working on as `.clineignore`.
# (Roo Code reads the same patterns as `.rooignore`.)
#
# Two jobs at once (docs/m3-plan.md §5):
#   1. Context budget — the workspace listing and every file search shrink,
#      which matters enormously on a 24k client window.
#   2. Privacy — secrets must never be read into a prompt. The prompt lives on
#      in client-side history even though it only ever travels to our gateway.
#
# Anything listed here genuinely cannot be read by the agent. If it needs a
# file you excluded, paste the relevant lines into the chat yourself.

# --- secrets: non-negotiable --------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
secrets/
*.key
*.pem
credentials*
deploy/fleet.local.yaml

# --- bulk that burns the window ----------------------------------------------
node_modules/
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
dist/
build/
*.log

# --- lockfiles: large, generated, never worth prompt tokens -------------------
uv.lock
package-lock.json
poetry.lock

# --- data and weights ---------------------------------------------------------
models/
*.gguf
*.safetensors
data/
outputs/
documents/
